    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban fireworks, disposable BBQs & fires in public (Apr-Oct) bar official events",
        "additional_details": "Exemption for official or organised events where a proper risk assessment has been carried out.",
        "background": "We want a new law to be introduced making the use of disposable BBQs, fireworks and open fires in public outdoor spaces between April and October a criminal offence.",
